* [[Upma]]{{spaced ndash}} a common [[South India]]n and [[Sri Lankan Tamil people|Sri Lankan Tamil]] breakfast dish, cooked as a thick porridge from [[Dry roasting|dry roasted]] [[semolina]]. Various seasonings and vegetables are often added during the cooking.
