===V===
[[File:Klappgröt.jpg|thumb|[[Vispipuuro]]]]
* [[Vispipuuro]]{{spaced ndash}} a sweet, [[wheat]] [[semolina]] (''manna'') dessert porridge made with berries, usually [[Vaccinium vitis-idaea|lingonberries]]. It is eaten in Sweden, Finland and Estonia.

===W===
* [[Wheatena]]{{spaced ndash}} an [[United States|American]] high-[[Dietary fiber|fiber]], toasted-[[wheat]] [[cereal]] that originated on [[Mulberry Street (Manhattan)|Mulberry Street]] in [[New York City]], New York, circa 1879, when a small [[bakery]] owner began roasting [[whole wheat]], grinding it, and packaging it for sale under this brand name.

